{# Cloudflare Web Analytics — beacon-only, cookieless. Renders only when
   site.analytics.beaconToken is set. After Gate 1 confirms green, the
   operator creates the Analytics site at the Cloudflare dashboard and
   pastes the token into src/_data/site.js to enable. #}
{%- if site.analytics and site.analytics.beaconToken -%}
<script defer src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js" data-cf-beacon='{"token": "{{ site.analytics.beaconToken }}"}'></script>
{%- endif -%}
